From 069fdbdcedc9c77835e2be2109b1840586e852c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:06:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Headset page: optional session log (Debugging)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Envision kept the XR service output only in its debug view until the next
start, so a problem seen in a normal session left nothing to look at.
Headset → Debugging → Keep session logs (off by default) saves each
session's service output in ~/.cache/pimax-linux/sessions, keeping the
newest 10.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
